m 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Alg